@startuml
title Resumefolio | Conditional workflow run control
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
if (Required feasibility / security enabling gate satisfied?) then (yes)
 :Validate supported definition, trigger, revision and run authority;
 if (Eligible, bounded resources and isolation available?) then (yes)
  :Run agreed work with only permitted inputs / scoped secrets;
  :Record actual step / run result and restricted outputs;
  if (Deployment stage requested?) then (yes)
   if (Target authority, result, revision and approval conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
    :Perform only permitted controlled target operation;
    :Record actual verification / failure / unknown target result;
   else (no)
    :Do not perform protected deployment; <<#FEF3C7>>
   endif
  endif
  :Handle cancellation / loss / retry by operation-specific policy;
  :Apply defined cleanup, retention and accounting;
 else (no)
  :Show defined rejected / pending outcome without execution; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (pending)
 :Record blocker and do not enable affected execution; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
Conceptual flow; no runner, syntax subset, trigger or numeric limit chosen.
Push, merge and successful checks do not inherently approve deployment.
Unknown consequential effects require explicit reconciliation before retry.
endlegend
@enduml
